<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Energy flow diagram illustrating trophic levels in an ecosystem, labeled P, D, II, III, and IV, with arrows showing quantities for consumption, respiration, import, export, flow from detritus, biomass, TST, and TE. A legend below defines terms and relationships.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
