<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Heatmap graphic showing interactions between aquatic functional groups, with impacted groups listed vertically and impacting groups horizontally. Color gradient from red \(negative interactions, -1.0\) to blue \(positive interactions, 1.0\) represents the MIT index. Intensely red and blue squares highlight strong negative and positive relationships among groups such as small demersal fishes, jellyfish, and cartilaginous fishes.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
